!!! archon/model/target.mat
!!! Something Archon scans.
!!!
!!! A target has a human label, a kind (source, configuration, permission,
!!! dependency, runtime, ...) and its content. In this host-side increment the
!!! content is a text buffer; later units load it from a file or a live
!!! semantic source without changing the finding model.

book archon.model.target

read everything from ny.lang.core

public scan-target begin record
    field label as text
    field kind as text
    field content as text
end record
